      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOMORROW WENDY (8) is an honest type rarely out of the money, scoring at this track (18.10) last time and making it six straight wins. Hard to go past form at this journey. Drawn out but with clear running expected to go close. GO GO SPIRIT (1) was below best at his last start when 7th at this track following a second place finish (18.58) there two back. Form here at the trip sound including four wins. Worth another chance. ANJO RUBY (2) turned in a modest effort most recently when seventh at this track over 401m behind Domineering (23.90) in a Grade 4/5. The form out of last race has been strong. Key runner on best form. SILVERTREE ADAM (5) was strongly fancied last time on the back of some superb recent form, including a five-run winning streak, but could only manage second (18.54) at this track. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from five starts.",
